<p class=3D"para">We use cookies and similar technologies on our website. C=
ookies are text files containing small amounts of information, which your c=
omputer or mobile device downloads when you visit a website. When you retur=
n to websites, or visit websites that use the same cookies, they recognise =
these cookies and therefore your browsing device.</p>
<p class=3D"para">We use different types of cookies for different things, s=
uch as:</p>
